              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumelwe nilabe ngenkatho njengefa lenu nelabafokazi abagogobele phakathi kwenu, abayozala abantwana phakathi kwenu; bayakuba kini njengabazalelwe ezweni phakathi kwabantwana bakwa-Israyeli; ayoba nefa kanye nawe phakathi kwezizwe zakwa-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
